{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'set -eu\nskill_dir=\"/tmp/20260810T121526Z-benchmark8/1.4.0/source/planning\"; plan_dir=\"$PWD/basic-test-proof-1.4.0-20260810T121526Z-benchmark8-isolated-plan\"\n\"$skill_dir/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --step-paragraph \"$plan_dir\" 01-button-chain/03-step-behavior 5.1 '\"'Implement only the button-chain initializer and click handler in button-chain.html. Track generated-button activations deterministically. For activations one through three, create exactly one new button and insert it immediately below the current last button, making that new control the current last button. On activation four, clear the document and render one visible terminal element whose text is exactly finished and whose class uses .completion-message. Do not add unrelated controls, persistence, or network behavior.'\n\\\"\"'$skill_dir/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --step-paragraph \"$plan_dir\" 01-button-chain/03-step-behavior 6.1 '\"'The first three clicks result in exactly 2, 3, and 4 visible buttons respectively, with one new button below the prior last button. The fourth generated-button click removes the button chain and leaves exact lowercase finished with the completion-message border.'\n\\\"\"'$skill_dir/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --step-paragraph \"$plan_dir\" 7.1 '\"'W04 consumes the complete future HTML contract and runs US-01 from a fresh local-file context.'\n\\\"\"'$skill_dir/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --step-paragraph \"$plan_dir\" 02-ui-validation/01-step-us-01 5.1 '\"'Use a fresh browser context and the US-01 cache. Open the planned local button-chain.html route. Confirm one initial button, click the current visible last button once, wait for exactly two buttons, repeat for exactly three and four buttons, then click the fourth generated button and wait for the terminal state. Record direct mouse interaction, actual waits, button counts, exact text, visible white border, URL, and decisive screenshot or observable assertion. Do not use console evaluation, injected events, storage edits, direct API calls, or any shortcut.'\n\\\"\"'$skill_dir/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --step-paragraph \"$plan_dir\" 02-ui-validation/01-step-us-01 6.1 '\"'US-01 is passed only when all four clicks are direct mouse input; counts are exactly 2, 3, and 4 after clicks one through three; the fourth generated-button click clears the document; and exact lowercase finished with a visible white border is observable. Otherwise mark the story bug found or untested with evidence.'\n\\\"\"'$skill_dir/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --step-paragraph \"$plan_dir\" 02-ui-validation/01-step-us-01 7.1 '\"'On pass, update ui-user-stories.md and ui-story-runs/US-01.md with actual evidence and hand the validated contract to the final analysis report. On failure, follow bug-register.md and retain the failure trace.'\nprintf all_steps_ok\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
